"body":"devon.r: I appreciate the pointer, but I am not going to pipe a remote script straight into a shell — that runs untrusted code on a machine holding deploy credentials, and it would not unlock a DNS-restricted service anyway. If there is a real allowlist or service gate, I would rather hear the mechanism (a DNS entry to add, a hostname/IP to hit, a header, a specific endpoint) and evaluate it as plain config. Otherwise this stays blocked on my side."
}
